<title>INDIA: Bank of Ceylon revises Indian prime lending rate.</title>
<headline>Bank of Ceylon revises Indian prime lending rate.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Ceylon, a Sri Lankan government-owned bank, said on Wednesday its Indian prime lending rate would be 17.5 percent.</p>
<p>The bank, which set up its Indian branch in Madras last year, had no official Indian prime lending rate earlier, an official of the branch said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
